# Generated sprite YAML sidecars (manifests/tilesets); runtime uses the
# *_spritesheet.ron. The renderer still EMITS yaml as a throwaway dev-tool
# intermediate (debug-hitbox overlay, gif exporter) — it's just never
# tracked. All yaml under assets/sprites is generated output; authored
# input yaml lives in tools/ambition_sprite2d_renderer/configs/.
